    "body": "## Summary\n- add Spring Boot 4.1 `spring-boot-starter-restclient`, which provides the auto-configured `RestClient.Builder` required by `GoogleRoutesProvider`\n- add a focused context regression test with `dofast.routing.provider=google`\n\n## Bug\nWith `ROUTING_PROVIDER=google`, the API failed during Spring context startup because `GoogleRoutesProvider` required `RestClient.Builder` but the project only included `spring-boot-starter-web`. Spring Boot 4 splits blocking REST client auto-configuration into the dedicated REST client starter.\n\n## Merge gate\nDo not merge until Maven/API verify and the full existing CI suite are green.",
